title: StairsLanding
---
// Talk target of the stairs on the landing (Hotspots layer). On moving day his box is at
// the bottom. On the second Thursday they lead down to the corner shop, a separate room of
// the map (shop_door.yarn). Before that there is nothing to get down there.
-> Go down
    <<if can("R1MoveIn", "carry")>>
        <<next_scene Route1MoveInBox>>
    <<elseif in_box("R1Dinner2") and not $r1_thu2_knocked and is_done("R1Dinner2", "text")>>
        <<fade_out>>
        <<place Player ShopIn>>
        <<face Player up>>
        <<fade_in>>
    <<elseif in_box("R1Dinner2") and not $r1_thu2_knocked>>
        You: Her text first. Then I'll know what I need.
    <<elseif in_box("R1MoveIn") and not is_done("R1MoveIn", "keys")>>
        You: My box can wait. Keys first.
    <<else>>
        You: I've got nothing to get down there.
    <<endif>>
-> Look
    <<if in_box("R1Dinner2") and not $r1_thu2_knocked>>
        You: The corner shop's at the bottom of the street. Open till ten.
    <<elseif in_box("R1MoveIn") and not is_done("R1MoveIn", "carry")>>
        You: My box is down there. Everything I own, in one box.
    <<else>>
        You: Three floors of stairs. No lift. I carried my box up these.
    <<endif>>
===
